                <h3>Webhook Ingestion</h3>
                <p>Receives security alerts through an n8n production webhook and passes each event into the automation pipeline.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="case-card">
                <h3>Normalization &amp; Validation</h3>
                <p>Standardizes severity values and rejects malformed or unsupported alerts before response logic runs.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="case-card">
                <h3>Severity-Based Routing</h3>
                <p>Routes <strong>HIGH</strong>, <strong>MEDIUM</strong>, and <strong>LOW</strong> incidents into dedicated triage branches.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="case-card">
                <h3>Incident Enrichment</h3>
